  "question": "证明当 $x > 0$ 时， $\\frac{\\ln(x + 1)}{x} >\\frac{x}{e^x - 1}$",
  "answer": "$f(x) > f(\\mathbf{e}^x - 1)$ ，即 $\\frac{\\ln(x + 1)}{x} > \\frac{x}{\\mathbf{e}^x - 1}$ .",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "单调性",
    "辅助函数"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 记 $f(x) = \\frac{\\ln (x + 1)}{x}$ ，所证不等式为 $f(x) > f(\\mathbf{e}^x - 1)$ 。易知 $\\mathbf{e}^x - 1 > x$ ，只需判定 $f(x)$ 单调递减。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "设 $f(x) = \\frac{\\ln(x + 1)}{x} (x > 0)$ ，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\nf ^ {\\prime} (x) = \\frac {\\frac {x}{1 + x} - \\ln (x + 1)}{x ^ {2}} <   0 \\quad \\left(\\because \\frac {x}{1 + x} <   \\ln (x + 1)\\right).\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "所以 $f(x)$ 严格单调递减."
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "又因为 $\\mathbf{e}^x - 1 > x$ ，所以 $f(x) > f(\\mathbf{e}^x - 1)$ ，即 $\\frac{\\ln(x + 1)}{x} > \\frac{x}{\\mathbf{e}^x - 1}$ ."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$f(x) > f(\\mathbf{e}^x - 1)$ ，即 $\\frac{\\ln(x + 1)}{x} > \\frac{x}{\\mathbf{e}^x - 1}$ .",
    "techniques_used": [
      "单调性",
      "辅助函数"
    ]
  },
